node_modules

# dist/ IS committed, deliberately. `bin` points into it, and consumers install this
# package straight from a git tag — where no build ever runs. bun does not install a
# git dependency's devDependencies, so a `prepare: tsc` step cannot work there (it
# fails the whole install with `tsc: command not found`). Shipping the built output
# is what makes `bun add github:…/art-commission#v0.1` produce a working binary.
# Rebuild with `bun run build` before tagging a release; CI checks it is current.
